# Controlled single-family walk_2d (jolt-diagnosis control group).
# Identical to demo_walk_2d_triangulated except the cross-family jogCurve anchor
# is removed. Speed axis is kept via the same-family walkStraightTwiceAsFast clip.
# Purpose: isolate whether hull jolt is caused by the cross-family jog anchor
# (data gap) or is structural to PMG blending. One variable changed vs the
# triangulated demo: the jog example.

node walk_2d 2
registration walk_2d - - 3 0
parameter_metrics walk_2d turn_rate travel_speed
parameter_calibration walk_2d 5
parameter_support walk_2d triangulated_2d

example walk_2d -0.3 0.0 ../BVH/walkMoreCurve.bvh
example walk_2d  0.0 0.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk_2d  1.0 0.0 ../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh start_frame 33 end_frame 67 phase_label left_contact_start contact_start L=contact;R=swing contact_end L=contact;R=swing
example walk_2d  0.15 0.75 ../BVH/walkStraightTwiceAsFast.bvh

triangle walk_2d 0 1 3
triangle walk_2d 1 2 3

expect walk_2d spanned_axes 2

edge walk_2d walk_2d
edge_phase_range walk_2d walk_2d 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config walk_2d walk_2d 120 234 3 6 41
